  "text": "## 4 stays near Cloud 9\n\n3 nights, up to PHP 4,500 per night. Sample prices, cheapest first.\n\n- **Boardwalk Family Homestay** (Cloud 9, rated 4.4): PHP 1,600 per night, PHP 4,800 for 3 nights. Family run rooms with breakfast, 6 min walk to the Cloud 9 boardwalk.\n- **Cloud 9 Surf Cabins** (Cloud 9, rated 4.6): PHP 2,800 per night, PHP 8,400 for 3 nights. Thatched cabins with board racks, 3 min walk to the break.\n- **Catangnan Garden Bungalows** (Cloud 9, rated 4.5): PHP 3,400 per night, PHP 10,200 for 3 nights. Quiet garden bungalows on the Cloud 9 road, aircon and fast wifi.\n- **Tuason Point Pool Suites** (Cloud 9, rated 4.7): PHP 4,200 per night, PHP 12,600 for 3 nights. Small pool, ocean view rooms, 8 min walk to Cloud 9.\n\n**Local tip:** stays on the Cloud 9 road are a short walk to the break and to food. Further inland is cheaper but you will want a scooter.",
